T*
() Tj
T*
(   5. Complexity Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   - File Open / Close Overhead: O\(1\) OS syscall.) Tj
T*
(   - Line Iteration Time: O\(N\) where N is file size; Space: O\(1\) streaming buffer memory.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
