(   - re.finditer\(pat, str\): Returns an iterator yielding Match objects for all non-overlapping) Tj
T*
(   matches \(Memory efficient!\).) Tj
T*
(   - re.sub\(pat, repl, str\): Searches and replaces all matches with repl.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Code Demonstration:) Tj
T*
(   import re) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   log_data = "IP: 192.168.1.10 - User: admin - Status: 200\\nIP: 10.0.0.5 - User: guest - Status:) Tj
T*
(   404") Tj
