(   [Problem Statement]: Implement a Web Server Log File Parser in Python using Regular Expressions, extracting IP addresses, HTTP status codes, endpoints, and error distributions.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Problem Context:) Tj
T*
(   Given an Apache/Nginx Combined Log Format stream:) Tj
T*
(   IP - - [Timestamp] "METHOD /path HTTP/1.1" STATUS BYTES) Tj
T*
(   Develop a regular expression parser that extracts fields, tallies HTTP status distribution) Tj
T*
(   \(200, 404, 500\), and identifies top requesting IP addresses.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
