(   1. Problem Context:) Tj
T*
(   Verify credit card numbers by combining regex structural format validation \(16 digits separated) Tj
T*
(   by spaces/hyphens\) with Luhn's Algorithm \(Modulus 10 checksum\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Luhn's Algorithm:) Tj
T*
(   1. Double every second digit from right to left.) Tj
T*
(   2. If doubling yields >= 10, sum the digits \(e.g. 14 -> 1 + 4 = 5\).) Tj
T*
(   3. Sum all modified and unmodified digits.) Tj
T*
(   4. If sum % 10 == 0, the card number is mathematically valid.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Python Implementation:) Tj
T*
(   import re) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   class PaymentValidator:) Tj
T*
(   CARD_REGEX = re.compile\(r'^\(\\d{4}[- ]?\){3}\\d{4}$'\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   @staticmethod) Tj
T*
(   def luhn_check\(card_number_str: str\) -> bool:) Tj
T*
(   digits = [int\(ch\) for ch in card_number_str if ch.isdigit\(\)]) Tj
T*
(   if len\(digits\) != 16:) Tj
T*
(   return False) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   checksum = 0) Tj
T*
(   reverse_digits = digits[::-1]) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   for idx, d in enumerate\(reverse_digits\):) Tj
T*
(   if idx % 2 == 1:) Tj
T*
(   doubled = d * 2) Tj
T*
(   checksum += \(doubled - 9\) if doubled > 9 else doubled) Tj
T*
(   else:) Tj
T*
(   checksum += d) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   return checksum % 10 == 0) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   @classmethod) Tj
T*
(   def validate_card\(cls, card_str: str\) -> bool:) Tj
T*
(   if not cls.CARD_REGEX.match\(card_str\):) Tj
T*
(   return False) Tj
T*
(   return cls.luhn_check\(card_str\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Verification) Tj
T*
(   sample_card = "4532-0150-1234-5678") Tj
T*
(   is_valid_format = bool\(PaymentValidator.CARD_REGEX.match\(sample_card\)\)) Tj
T*
(   is_valid_luhn = PaymentValidator.luhn_check\(sample_card\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Card: '{sample_card}'"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Format Regex Valid? {is_valid_format}"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"Luhn Algorithm Valid? {is_valid_luhn}"\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Complexity Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   - Time Complexity: O\(1\) constant time \(exactly 16 digits\).) Tj
T*
(   - Space Complexity: O\(1\) integer registers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
ET

