(   [Problem Statement]: Implement a Sensitive Data Sanitizer and PII Redactor in Python using Regular Expressions to mask emails, phone numbers, and SSNs in unstructured text.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Problem Context:) Tj
T*
(   Enterprise privacy regulations \(GDPR, HIPAA\) require scrubbing Personally Identifiable) Tj
T*
(   Information \(PII\) before sharing logs or training machine learning models:) Tj
T*
(   - Email addresses -> '[EMAIL_REDACTED]') Tj
T*
(   - Phone numbers -> '[PHONE_REDACTED]') Tj
T*
(   - SSN / National IDs -> '[SSN_REDACTED]') Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Python Implementation:) Tj
T*
(   import re) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   class PIIRedactor:) Tj
T*
(   EMAIL_REGEX = re.compile\(r'[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\\.[A-Z|a-z]{2,7}'\)) Tj
T*
(   PHONE_REGEX = re.compile\(r'\(?:\\+?\\d{1,3}[-.\\s]?\)?\\\(?\\d{3}\\\)?[-.\\s]?\\d{3}[-.\\s]?\\d{4}'\)) Tj
T*
(   SSN_REGEX = re.compile\(r'\\d{3}-\\d{2}-\\d{4}'\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   @classmethod) Tj
T*
(   def sanitize\(cls, text: str\) -> str:) Tj
T*
(   text = cls.EMAIL_REGEX.sub\("[EMAIL_REDACTED]", text\)) Tj
T*
(   text = cls.PHONE_REGEX.sub\("[PHONE_REDACTED]", text\)) Tj
T*
(   text = cls.SSN_REGEX.sub\("[SSN_REDACTED]", text\)) Tj
T*
(   return text) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   # Demonstration) Tj
T*
(   unclean_medical_notes = """) Tj
T*
(   Patient Aarav Sharma \(SSN: 123-45-6789\) visited cardiology on 2026-10-26.) Tj
T*
(   Contact email: aarav.sharma@health.org, Mobile: +1-555-839-2041.) Tj
T*
(   Emergency Contact: priya@family.net, Phone: \(555\) 234-5678.) Tj
T*
(   """) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   sanitized_notes = PIIRedactor.sanitize\(unclean_medical_notes\)) Tj
T*
(   print\("Sanitized Medical Notes Output:"\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(sanitized_notes.strip\(\)\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Complexity Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   - Time Complexity: O\(N\) linear sweep across text length.) Tj
T*
(   - Space Complexity: O\(N\) memory for sanitized output string.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
