(   [Problem Statement]: Implement a Safe Atomic File Writer in Python using Context Managers, ensuring files are never corrupted by mid-write crashes.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Problem Context:) Tj
T*
(   If a system crashes or process is killed while writing to an important file, the file is left) Tj
T*
(   partially written and corrupted!) Tj
T*
(   Atomic Writing Strategy:) Tj
T*
(   1. Write all data to a temporary file in the same filesystem directory.) Tj
T*
(   2. Flush and close the temporary file.) Tj
T*
(   3. Atomically replace the destination file using os.replace\(\).) Tj
T*
(   On modern operating systems \(POSIX rename and Windows MoveFileEx\), file replacement is) Tj
T*
(   guaranteed atomic at the filesystem inode level!) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Python Implementation:) Tj
T*
(   import os) Tj
T*
(   import tempfile) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   class AtomicFileWriter:) Tj
T*
(   def __init__\(self, target_path: str, mode="w", encoding="utf-8"\):) Tj
T*
(   self.target_path = target_path) Tj
T*
(   self.mode = mode) Tj
T*
(   self.encoding = encoding) Tj
T*
(   self._temp_file = None) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def __enter__\(self\):) Tj
T*
(   dir_name = os.path.dirname\(self.target_path\) or ".") Tj
T*
(   self._temp_file = tempfile.NamedTemporaryFile\() Tj
T*
(   self.mode, dir=dir_name, delete=False, encoding=self.encoding) Tj
T*
(   \)) Tj
T*
(   return self._temp_file) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   def __exit__\(self, exc_type, exc_val, exc_tb\):) Tj
T*
(   temp_name = self._temp_file.name) Tj
T*
(   self._temp_file.close\(\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   if exc_type is not None:) Tj
T*
(   # Crash occurred: delete temp file, leaving original untouched!) Tj
T*
(   if os.path.exists\(temp_name\):) Tj
T*
(   os.remove\(temp_name\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"[ABORT] Write failed. Original {self.target_path} preserved!"\)) Tj
T*
(   return False) Tj
T*
(   else:) Tj
T*
(   # Atomic swap) Tj
T*
(   os.replace\(temp_name, self.target_path\)) Tj
T*
(   print\(f"[COMMIT] Atomically updated {self.target_path}"\)) Tj
T*
(   return True) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

endstream
endobj
