T*
(   Python's struct module packs and unpacks native Python values \(integers, floats\) to and from C) Tj
T*
(   structs represented as Python bytes objects, essential for network packet protocol headers:) Tj
T*
(   - >: Big-endian \(network standard\)) Tj
